    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Do you love playing video games? Max, an 11-year-old boy from the U.K., does more than just play them. He makes his own games! Not long ago, Max set a world record. He is now the youngest male video game "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "developer",
            "zh": "开发者"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the world."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Earlier last year, Max "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "decided",
            "ref": "v-decide"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to go for a world record. "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Guinness World Records",
            "zh": "吉尼斯世界纪录机构"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " sent him all the rules and things he needed. Experts watched closely to make sure he did everything "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "on his own",
            "ref": "v-on-ones-own"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". In just four hours, Max "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "created",
            "ref": "v-create"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a new game. It has five fun levels, and each one is different from the others."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "After six months of waiting, Max finally got the news: His record "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "attempt",
            "zh": "尝试"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " was successful. He said it was “amazing” to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "achieve",
            "ref": "v-achieve"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " his world record. He was really happy to be "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "recognized",
            "ref": "v-recognize"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for his hard work."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Max first started "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "coding",
            "ref": "v-code"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " when he was seven. Since then, he has made and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "published",
            "zh": "发布"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " several of his own games. He also hopes to become a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "full-time",
            "zh": "全职的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " video game designer in the future. He added, “I like coding because whatever you dream of, you can turn it into code and make it real.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "instruction": "Choose the best answer.",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q1",
          "number": 1,
          "points": 1,
          "skills": [
            "detail"
          ],
          "interaction": {
            "kind": "choice",
            "variant": "standard",
            "maxChoices": 1,
            "prompt": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "What makes Max special compared to other children?"
              }
            ],
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "A",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "He plays video games better than others."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "B",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "He creates his own video games at a young age."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "C",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "He works for a famous game company."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "D",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "He teaches other children how to code."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "q2",
          "number": 2,
          "points": 1,
          "skills": [
            "detail"
          ],
          "interaction": {
            "kind": "choice",
            "variant": "standard",
            "maxChoices": 1,
            "prompt": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "Why did experts watch Max closely while he was making the game?"
              }
            ],
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "A",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "To give him advice when he made mistakes."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "B",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "To help him finish the game within four hours."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "C",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "To check that he completed the work by himself."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "D",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "To score each of the five levels he created."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "q3",
          "number": 3,
          "points": 1,
          "skills": [
            "inference"
          ],
          "interaction": {
            "kind": "choice",
            "variant": "standard",
            "maxChoices": 1,
            "prompt": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "What can we learn from the process of Max’s record attempt?"
              }
            ],
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "A",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "Creating a five-level game usually takes six months."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "B",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "It takes time for the official organization to check the results."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "C",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "Max was the only person who applied for this record this year."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "D",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "Guinness World Records only accepts 11-year-old applicants."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "q4",
          "number": 4,
          "points": 1,
          "skills": [
            "attitude"
          ],
          "interaction": {
            "kind": "choice",
            "variant": "standard",
            "maxChoices": 1,
            "prompt": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "Which of the following best describes Max’s view on coding?"
              }
            ],
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "A",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "Coding is a tool that turns imagination into something real."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "B",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "Playing video games is the best way to prepare for a future job."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "C",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "Only children who have coding skills can become record holders."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "D",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "Coding helps him become famous around the world."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "q5",
          "number": 5,
          "points": 1,
          "skills": [
            "main_idea"
          ],
          "interaction": {
            "kind": "choice",
            "variant": "standard",
            "maxChoices": 1,
            "prompt": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "What is the main purpose of this article?"
              }
            ],
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "A",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "To explain how to create a five-level video game in four hours."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "B",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "To describe the history and the rules of Guinness World Records."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "C",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "To introduce a young boy’s achievement and encourage creativity."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "D",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "To warn students not to spend too much time on video games."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
